The '''Lotus Eater's Cave''' is a {{Skl|Fishing}} [[Locations|Location]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} and home of {{NPCSprite|The Lotus Eater}}.

{{ZoneText|Catch &5Cave Frogs&f.|Throw a &aFrogcoin &finto the pond for good luck!}}
== Purpose ==
=== Fishing ===
The '''Lotus Eater's Cave''' serves as a place to go [[Fishing]] for {{Item|Cave Frog}}s, a type of [[Trophy Frog]].

=== Frogcoin Donations ===
{{Item|Frogcoin}}s can be thrown into the water of the '''Lotus Eater's Cave''' to donate it, granting {{Green|1}} randomly chosen buffs, excluding ones already active, for {{Green|30}} minutes while on the [[Lotus Atoll]]:

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Random Rewards
|-
| {{Stat|Treasure Chance|+1}}
|-
| {{Stat|trophy chance|+5}} 
|-
| {{Stat|Scc|+2.5}}
|-
| {{Stat|Fs|+10}} 
|}

While under any of these effects, the player is able to catch the {{Item|Blessed Frog}} [[Trophy Frog]]. Once a {{Green|fourth}} {{Item|Frogcoin}} is thrown, the {{NPCSprite|The Lotus Eater}} NPC appears. Throwing multiple {{Item|Frogcoin}}s at the same time only consumes one of them, while the others remain in the water.
Attempting to throw a {{Green|fifth}} {{Item|Frogcoin}} does nothing.

